"╭─────────────────────── Monday, October 5 2026 (today) ───────────────────────╮"
"│1. ╭ Keybindings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   │"
"│   │ Search: type a key like x, or a word like undo                       │   │"
"│   │ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │   │"
"│   │ Change the list's and the leader menu's keys in keys.toml: open it   │   │"
"│   │ from the options (Space o), under Keys.                              │   │"
"│   │                                                                      │   │"
"│   │ List                                                                 │   │"
"│   │   h / ←               Previous day  prev-day                         │   │"
"│   │   l / →               Next day  next-day                             │   │"
"│   │   t                   Go to today  today                             │   │"
"│   │   j / ↓               Move down  down                                │   │"
"│   │   k / ↑               Move up  up                                    │   │"
"│   │   4j / 4k             Move four items down / up (any number)         │   │"
"│   │   gg                  First item  first                              │   │"
"│   │   G                   Last item, or with a number before it, that    │   │"
"│   │                       item  last                                     │   │"
"│   │   42G / :42           Go to item 42                                  │   │"
"│   │   J                   Move the item down the list  move-down         │   │"
"│   │   K                   Move the item up the list  move-up             │   │"
"│   │   H                   Move the item to the previous day              │   │"
"│   │                       move-to-prev-day                               │   │"
"╰───╰─────────────────────── ↑/↓ scroll · esc close ───────────────────────╯───╯"
